": "ss2.png", "id": "421888538948247", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982542_421888542281580_7961047171456036679_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YLW-K8jf-l8Q7kNvwHBanI0&_nc_oc=AdryRPGuP91g_9hgvLp5oe82l8gNL6-Tt7e0ArzHCmUCKQrkKg5Amd9if3pDi-7cyzc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR83Oh4SJaZfLcXT0cRvM3vh6aG53UNXNVPo1sXF_FzGQ&oe=6B0475E2"}, {"file_name": "ss1.png", "id": "900672037137096", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569452_900672040470429_3602208668542724751_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fzkE_je8iGsQ7kNvwFiF2sC&_nc_oc=AdrQaQMNh5LHRhocDIsJIR33LQIO5RxENhR2ykF4_8XGVEMei6AwdoZHuNGTBsm0QLc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQYcGusW6-DsHTT1F8KKtHrEf2geCdu5bKTPnOE41K3hA&oe=6B045D36"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "215595850179052", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036702_215595853512385_1516722769013058759_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7QuLnpWA8soQ7kNvwHDw-nH&_nc_oc=AdpEQCJyqw7I4Yg12tP6npT_KCkHFFJ4uuIFCtOlzKzP9N40eYeA4S6W__YrBMltAvI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQXE1Srk8lTSEdFkammeLiZRuCfSLCdqTr75y2ww0Ndzw&oe=6B0464A4"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "416146802772950", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982521_416146806106283_7161111592696257607_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jYiKKCAbjD0Q7kNvwFapNa0&_nc_oc=AdpASdnM9g4cFmfMIfuKpGwoIG7I0AWiPOHc9Yc8jK0nw2fsp34M63wxhSqCoG8qMFc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTRa2z8r5pf_TQHhyaH_cA9NmxMslmsvy5jdlMer1_YEg&oe=6B048250"}, {"file_name": "ss7.png", "id": "512472986379303", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_512472989712636_7638735751378089066_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7FZEHblVVCkQ7kNvwHlKaoF&_nc_oc=AdoHWcWqGHcnQOA7LgJYKy3sYBb5W_jmSd8o9Oc3d5HaKJThQFvtZs1qbYovtgcBlrs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSQc6Hns3gAZSrl1bANI79xfqgZLPX9QCEhPQFIpKznyQ&oe=6B047CE1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Counter Fight ICHIRAN", "keywords": ["ICHIRAN", "CounterFight", "JobSimulator", "Ramen", "cooking"], "long_description": "Make some mouth-watering ramen!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game created with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan. Established over 60 years ago, it's been perfecting its hit specialty tonkotsu ramen for a long time, which is why ICHIRAN's ramen is the best in the land. In fact, it's often touted in the media as a \"must-try cuisine\" for foreign visitors.\n\nGame Features:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score! \nImmersive kitchen-based gameplay lets you experience life as a real ICHIRAN employee, racking up points for your ramen preparation skills and speedy delivery.\n\n\u30fbClimb the ranks in store management mode! \nYour score in store management mode is entered into a world ranking. Boost your profits to employ more staff and increase seating capacity as you try to hit the high scores with your own unique store!\n\n*In-game kitchen layout may differ from actual restaurants.", "short_description": "Cook some knockout noodles!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game made with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous organic tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan, often touted as a \"must-try cuisine\" for tourists. It has outlets in NY, Hong Kong, and Taiwan, too.\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score!\n\u30fbTake top place in store management mode!\n\u30fbBoost profits, employ more staff, up capacity, and hit the high scores with your own unique store!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "MiniLandscape.png", "id": "3838591046231584", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984462_3838591052898250_5002299579482394963_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-PUCWtoqPWkQ7kNvwGGCA1i&_nc_oc=AdpEttzsKvH3gIF6YK8V9NreGqhwEoNyPSaHyXCOucMRxweRNtmokWeuHSlDoIBjKr4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSqthx6uvBvbW6ZIi0c4D4MLyIgcDYOIUxeJdMl5Fl2tQ&oe=6B04679E"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "2182671695203710", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_2182671698537043_1819436220465957851_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GIKXGk7DxVYQ7kNvwEqTIz4&_nc_oc=Adp4uc0jeXju2vhu8wvrrprFxqJXLXuELDHdrFfeUnb7ej7GqpRuyjhptIbjrcYIY30&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRKJ_lbcebarnByEO69RJktnJTl7MzzSOdUkqvGEfvTWg&oe=6B047D3B"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "446502446404480", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476755_446502449737813_695504826495623275_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nyQsGD-BIqoQ7kNvwFHthfJ&_nc_oc=AdrSIKt6kUrO3-3LtfOsn8IGbsai_BYSbHP6rYLKvxuJUJMSS_Zt50awoAj2i-LLjiY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQY95T6vd1LU-mQQXh4v7D0Pqja-BVFm0xUNAuU1sqZzA&oe=6B046961"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "442920633578734", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240108_442920636912067_8939691330164956004_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6oDF9nBvZBkQ7kNvwFmjECe&_nc_oc=Ado5Dbx7lxU5NjF0stK-7R1vq7nMuLLayAq-egL5zK_eKhAyPWTdaYjJXYpQqbNjdAA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQqzAd4N5HsqOYXOENDAWffSe3qpoI_I1bR